      guideIntro: "Area View combines map information, your device GPS, and live route signals to help you search and navigate. Read these points before relying on a result.",
      guideAddressTitle: "Similar address names",
      guideAddressBody: "Different streets, junctions, businesses, or communities can have the same or similar name. A spelling difference or incomplete address can also produce the wrong match. Always check the pin, street, landmark, and destination before starting.",
      guideNetworkTitle: "Slow or failed loading",
      guideNetworkBody: "Map tiles, address search, traffic information, and routes need a working connection. A poor network may make them slow or temporarily fail. Area View can show recent saved information while it loads and refreshes automatically when the connection returns.",
      guideTrafficTitle: "Traffic information is an estimate",
      guideTrafficBody: "KunThai does not receive live data from road sensors or traffic authorities. Traffic levels are estimated from route travel times, typical busy hours, road reports shared by the community, and the movement of nearby KunThai operators. These signals can be delayed, incomplete, or unavailable where few people use the app, so a road shown as clear may still be congested. Use traffic information as a guide only: allow extra time, and always follow road signs, traffic officers, and the conditions you can see.",
      guideSmartTitle: "Smart automatic rerouting",
      guideSmartBody: "Area View compares your live position with the recommended road route. If you move far enough away, it waits briefly to avoid reacting to noisy GPS and then recalculates automatically in most cases. Weak GPS, missing road data, or a poor network can prevent an automatic switch.",
      guideSaveMeTitle: "When SAVE ME appears",
      guideSaveMeBody: "SAVE ME appears when Area View detects a wrong route or cannot use the current route. Tap it to request a new high-accuracy location, move the map back to your exact position, and either reconnect you to the route or calculate a new route from where you are. Location permission and a clear GPS signal are required.",
      guideLateTitle: "Late-hours route warning",
      guideLateBody: "From 8:00 PM to 5:00 AM, do not follow a KunThai recommended route unless you have independently confirmed it is safe. A recommendation cannot guarantee that a road is open, lit, secure, or suitable at that time. Prefer a familiar, well-lit main road, travel with someone when possible, and stop in a public place if conditions feel unsafe.",
